WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.980
Episode 58
Tokyo No. 1 Colony, Part 5

00:05.790 --> 00:07.750
Domain Expansion:

00:07.750 --> 00:09.780
Chimera Shadow Garden.

00:16.090 --> 00:18.870
Esoteric Technique: Hollow Wicker Basket!

00:21.200 --> 00:26.840
Hollow Wicker Basket is the origin of
New Shadow Style's "Simple Domain."

00:26.840 --> 00:28.970
It possesses the ability
to neutralize a domain

00:28.970 --> 00:32.490
and counter its guaranteed-hit factor.

00:32.490 --> 00:34.480
Too bad!

00:35.180 --> 00:38.790
The "Domain Amplification" used
by Jogo and Hanami in Shibuya

00:38.790 --> 00:40.720
utilized a domain capable of harboring

00:40.720 --> 00:43.260
a guaranteed-hit,
guaranteed-kill technique...

00:45.850 --> 00:47.860
Why is it hitting me?!

00:47.860 --> 00:51.160
...and intentionally left out
their cursed techniques

00:51.160 --> 00:55.070
to leave space for Gojo's
cursed technique to flow into,

00:55.070 --> 00:57.160
neutralizing his Limitless.

00:57.440 --> 01:00.080
However, Hollow Wicker
Basket and Simple Domain

01:00.080 --> 01:03.500
aren't capable of neutralizing
the cursed technique.

01:03.840 --> 01:07.890
They work by neutralizing a barrier
imbued with a cursed technique

01:07.890 --> 01:12.340
to nullify the imbued technique's
guaranteed-hit effect.

01:14.880 --> 01:18.400
However, Fushiguro's
domain is incomplete.

01:18.400 --> 01:20.500
You're not sneering anymore.

01:20.500 --> 01:22.270
Damn brat!

01:23.960 --> 01:29.410
By transposing his domain onto
the space of the gymnasium,

01:29.410 --> 01:31.750
he managed to force it to close,

01:31.750 --> 01:34.610
but it's not imbued with a
guaranteed-hit technique.

01:36.240 --> 01:38.190
Don't act like you've won!

01:39.480 --> 01:41.090
Now I see.

01:41.090 --> 01:42.950
Chimera Shadow Garden

01:42.950 --> 01:47.170
currently just extends his
Ten Shadows Technique,

01:47.170 --> 01:52.070
and draws out 120% of
his latent potential.

01:52.580 --> 01:54.960
However, that very imperfection

01:54.960 --> 01:57.550
is what caught Reggie Star off-guard.

01:57.550 --> 02:02.130
Both his clones and his shikigami had
physical forms before striking me.

02:02.130 --> 02:03.660
That means this barrier

02:03.660 --> 02:06.140
isn't imbued with a
guaranteed-hit technique!

02:06.520 --> 02:10.620
The domain's buff to his technique's
abilities is no joke, though.

02:10.620 --> 02:14.000
This is even worse to deal with than
a simple guaranteed-hit domain!

02:14.000 --> 02:17.830
If he pulls out that elephant
here and drenches me in water,

02:17.830 --> 02:20.960
it'll halve my options,
and I'll probably lose.

02:28.580 --> 02:29.950
But...

02:29.950 --> 02:32.150
it's so like me

02:32.150 --> 02:35.010
to make sure that won't happen.

02:35.970 --> 02:37.010
Nue!

02:41.810 --> 02:43.370
Too slow!

02:47.060 --> 02:48.780
I knew it.

02:50.980 --> 02:53.300
For a while now,

02:53.300 --> 02:57.320
I've had to reinforce my footing with
cursed energy to avoid getting sucked in.

03:00.750 --> 03:05.280
The whole bottom of this domain
is your shadow, right?

03:05.290 --> 03:10.440
Being able to store and remove yourself
and objects is convenient, isn't it?

03:10.440 --> 03:13.180
But one thing nagged at me.

03:13.180 --> 03:15.690
"He doesn't have many weapons."

03:15.690 --> 03:19.010
I've only seen you use
one paltry cursed tool.

03:19.010 --> 03:20.650
Either it has a low capacity

03:20.650 --> 03:25.230
and you need to reserve space
for yourself at all times,

03:25.230 --> 03:31.730
or you're forced to bear the weight of
things stored in your shadow yourself.

03:33.500 --> 03:35.480
Looks like the latter was spot-on!

03:35.900 --> 03:39.490
Now I've turned the design
of your domain against you.

03:39.490 --> 03:44.410
With three passenger cars,
your current weight is 2.4 tons.

03:44.810 --> 03:47.210
Looks like your clones weren't
able to tolerate it,

03:47.210 --> 03:50.420
but can you still produce your shikigami?

03:51.160 --> 03:54.450
Either way, I'll just
need to mind my footing

03:54.450 --> 03:58.960
as I keep adding weight until
you're crushed under it.

04:01.470 --> 04:03.750
Are you stupid?

04:03.750 --> 04:05.150
Huh?

04:05.150 --> 04:08.700
Even if it's incomplete,
a domain is still a domain!

04:10.350 --> 04:12.940
My shadow's above us, too!

04:24.740 --> 04:27.190
Which of us will get crushed first,

04:27.760 --> 04:29.260
Reggie?!

04:40.520 --> 04:41.200
JUJUTSU KAISEN

05:04.510 --> 05:08.720
JUJUTSU KAISEN
The Culling Game Part 1

06:03.830 --> 06:09.170
It's said that a typical human will
lose consciousness at five to six Gs.

06:09.830 --> 06:11.570
2.4 tons.

06:12.170 --> 06:15.320
As Fushiguro weighed 60 kilograms,

06:15.320 --> 06:19.470
that meant he was currently
suffering 40 Gs.

06:20.260 --> 06:24.080
In order to prevent his blood from
pooling in his legs from the high Gs

06:24.080 --> 06:27.200
and depriving his brain of blood flow,

06:27.200 --> 06:29.640
Fushiguro was lowering his posture

06:29.640 --> 06:31.920
and reinforcing his body
with cursed energy,

06:31.920 --> 06:34.780
paying special attention to his legs.

06:36.060 --> 06:40.530
A mature African elephant
weighs three to six tons.

06:41.930 --> 06:45.210
With the domain's improvement
to his technique's accuracy,

06:45.210 --> 06:48.590
Max Elephant accurately
recreated its real weight.

06:48.920 --> 06:54.820
Under that weight, Reggie Star's right
fibula and heel bone were cracked.

06:56.030 --> 06:58.760
Both of them faced

06:58.760 --> 07:02.620
the possibility of being crushed
to death at any second.

07:04.070 --> 07:06.000
I screwed up!

07:06.000 --> 07:08.840
I could have won if I'd kept
the trucks in reserve!

07:08.840 --> 07:10.330
What do I do?

07:10.330 --> 07:13.060
I got splashed with some
water at the same time,

07:13.060 --> 07:15.000
but my trump card's still safe.

07:15.000 --> 07:19.040
I could slip into his shadow and
recreate my trump card inside it.

07:19.040 --> 07:21.440
That would crush him!

07:23.390 --> 07:24.430
No...

07:24.430 --> 07:26.820
If he's not dismissing his domain,

07:26.820 --> 07:32.380
that means anything in his shadow is
stuck there after he dismisses his domain!

07:32.830 --> 07:36.930
What if I'm stuck in his shadow
forever after he dies?

07:37.560 --> 07:40.070
What's it like inside his shadow, anyway?

07:40.070 --> 07:43.040
It looks like a liquid,
but can I breathe in it?

07:43.040 --> 07:44.060
Can I float?

07:44.510 --> 07:48.560
No. Submerging into his
shadow is too risky.

07:48.560 --> 07:51.370
So while stuck in this state...

07:52.160 --> 07:55.550
I have to pull out my trump
card and activate it!

07:59.520 --> 08:02.620
Contractual Re-Creation!

08:02.960 --> 08:05.250
Snap

08:22.400 --> 08:24.110
I didn't make it in time!

08:24.110 --> 08:27.260
And there's no air inside his shadow!

08:28.710 --> 08:31.540
No buoyancy or resistance, either!

08:34.240 --> 08:38.900
I'm just... sinking!

08:40.040 --> 08:43.790
My consciousness... is fading...

08:49.490 --> 08:51.850
Not yet! Endure it a little longer!

08:51.850 --> 08:54.720
Wait until I'm sure he's dead
before dismissing the domain!

08:54.720 --> 08:57.600
Then I can expel what's in my shadow!

09:30.180 --> 09:32.710
The things I recreate

09:32.710 --> 09:36.920
disappear soon after carrying
out the command I give them.

09:36.920 --> 09:40.180
I hadn't given the cars
I sank a command, though.

09:40.180 --> 09:43.430
I didn't want them
disappearing, after all.

09:43.430 --> 09:46.510
That meant I could still
issue them a command.

09:46.510 --> 09:49.330
"Take me and rise up!"

09:49.330 --> 09:53.900
The weight of one car is gone
now, but that saved my life.

09:57.800 --> 09:59.500
I'll admit it.

09:59.500 --> 10:01.440
You're strong.

10:01.950 --> 10:07.270
But I'm stronger!

10:07.270 --> 10:10.790
Contractual Re-Creation!

10:15.870 --> 10:21.340
A 132-square-foot,
two-story wooden frame structure!

10:21.340 --> 10:24.770
The framework alone weighs
at least thirty tons!

10:24.770 --> 10:27.610
Get crushed!

11:00.470 --> 11:02.240
What happened?!

11:02.240 --> 11:04.810
Did I fall into his shadow again?

11:06.090 --> 11:07.500
No!

11:07.500 --> 11:09.160
I'm in actual water!

11:09.160 --> 11:10.150
How?!

11:11.180 --> 11:12.320
It's heavy!

11:12.320 --> 11:15.110
Is that brat trying to strangle me?

11:15.440 --> 11:17.310
What power!

11:17.310 --> 11:19.050
No, that's wrong!

11:19.050 --> 11:22.420
It's from the weight of
the two cars I added!

11:24.600 --> 11:25.730
This is bad!

11:26.280 --> 11:28.060
This time, I'm sinking!

11:28.690 --> 11:31.960
I have to dismiss
Contractual Re-Creation!

11:50.140 --> 11:51.760
Right!

11:51.760 --> 11:53.760
This is a community gymnasium!

11:53.760 --> 11:56.970
And the gymnasium's basement
is a heated swimming pool!

11:59.790 --> 12:02.570
Did he flee into his shadow
and dismiss his domain,

12:02.570 --> 12:06.310
forcing me to destroy the floor
and plunge into the pool?

12:09.750 --> 12:13.080
You can't use your receipts when
they're that soaked, can you?

12:17.190 --> 12:20.590
He waited instead of
pursuing me immediately.

12:20.590 --> 12:24.010
He let his technique recover after
exhausting it with his domain, then?

12:24.870 --> 12:27.980
Are you sure about that?

12:28.740 --> 12:32.470
I'm betting you can't produce
shikigami anymore either, right?

12:33.650 --> 12:35.160
That's true.

12:35.160 --> 12:38.140
You do understand what
comes next, don't you?

12:39.650 --> 12:43.260
He'll use a shikigami other than that dog.

12:43.260 --> 12:45.540
But none of them can
deal a decisive blow.

12:45.540 --> 12:47.350
So use it!

12:47.350 --> 12:51.160
The moment you let up,
I'll finish you with a counter!

13:41.600 --> 13:46.370
Demon Dogs isn't weak enough
to let that stop it.

13:47.380 --> 13:52.010
Sorcerers are all liars, huh?

13:52.230 --> 13:55.010
JUJUTSU KAISEN

13:57.690 --> 14:00.030
JUJUTSU KAISEN

14:08.140 --> 14:09.970
The domain,

14:09.970 --> 14:11.180
the pool...

14:11.830 --> 14:16.380
All to convince me you couldn't
use that dog anymore.

14:16.380 --> 14:20.160
You didn't flee into this gymnasium.

14:20.160 --> 14:21.800
You lured me into it.

14:22.400 --> 14:24.450
To think I'd let a modern sorcerer,

14:24.450 --> 14:28.340
and a brat at that, get the better of me.

14:30.000 --> 14:33.830
Even if I wanted to flee, Nue can't
fly with someone for very long.

14:33.830 --> 14:36.100
I've struggled with that before.

14:41.820 --> 14:45.710
What's your relation to Tengen-sama?

14:49.610 --> 14:51.430
Tengen?

14:52.450 --> 14:55.080
Oh, right.

14:55.080 --> 14:57.370
They would still be alive, huh?

14:58.070 --> 15:00.350
That shut-in.

15:00.350 --> 15:02.340
Yeah? That's enough.

15:04.240 --> 15:08.340
Reggie said Tengen-sama's claims about
the Culling Game's goals were a bluff.

15:09.240 --> 15:12.340
I should probably consider
the possibility that

15:12.340 --> 15:16.330
Tengen-sama and Kenjaku are secretly
connected and lied about their goal,

15:17.000 --> 15:19.240
but that doesn't seem
likely from his reaction.

15:23.410 --> 15:28.880
Kogane, give him all my points.

15:29.360 --> 15:30.580
Okay!

15:32.030 --> 15:36.340
You have received
41 points from Reggie Star.

15:36.340 --> 15:37.820
What are you plotting?

15:38.550 --> 15:41.460
That's an awful thing to say.

15:41.460 --> 15:44.270
It's my good deed before I die.

15:44.970 --> 15:47.700
I'm just a spectator.

15:47.700 --> 15:50.350
I was never close friends with Kenjaku.

15:50.880 --> 15:54.430
I think doing this will
make things interesting.

15:54.940 --> 15:56.820
That's my intuition.

15:58.280 --> 16:00.190
Please.

16:00.190 --> 16:02.660
You did kill me, after all.

16:03.310 --> 16:10.310
Let fate toy with you
a bit, and die a fool.

16:33.160 --> 16:35.790
You have gained five points.

16:48.860 --> 16:50.180
Did I get him?!

16:50.710 --> 16:52.890
No! Don't let your guard down!

16:54.430 --> 16:55.820
He's tough!

16:55.820 --> 16:57.410
What the hell?!

16:56.410 --> 16:57.410
Slide

16:57.840 --> 16:59.990
Why are you covered in lotion?!

16:59.990 --> 17:01.450
It could be sauce.

17:01.450 --> 17:02.920
Shut up! Die!

17:04.470 --> 17:07.120
Wait, it really is sauce?!

17:07.390 --> 17:08.190
Damn it!

17:08.190 --> 17:10.110
Seriously, what's with this guy?!

17:10.110 --> 17:12.240
I've blown him up several times!

17:12.240 --> 17:14.440
I feel like I've killed him five times!

17:14.830 --> 17:17.410
So how does he have so little damage?!

17:16.180 --> 17:18.680
So little.

17:18.600 --> 17:20.010
You hate sauce?

17:20.520 --> 17:23.240
His first injury healed
at some point, too.

17:23.740 --> 17:27.720
But he hasn't shown any signs of using
reverse cursed techniques like I do.

17:28.350 --> 17:30.470
I don't get it!

17:31.030 --> 17:32.520
Hazenoki-sama.

17:32.520 --> 17:33.830
What?

17:33.830 --> 17:36.990
Reggie Star-sama has just died.

17:40.670 --> 17:42.220
Oh? What happened?

17:42.220 --> 17:43.550
I'm going home.

17:43.550 --> 17:44.920
I'm sick of this.

17:44.920 --> 17:46.010
Okay!

17:46.010 --> 17:47.140
Take a bath!

17:47.140 --> 17:48.460
And brush your teeth!

17:51.350 --> 17:54.000
Hey, man! Give me your points!

17:54.440 --> 17:55.670
Stop following me.

17:55.670 --> 17:59.360
Please! Just think of it
as going with the flow!

17:59.360 --> 18:00.350
Die.

18:00.660 --> 18:03.380
Takaba's cursed technique, Comedian,

18:03.380 --> 18:07.760
makes whatever he's convinced
would be funny a reality.

18:07.760 --> 18:11.860
It's a technique capable of
opposing even Satoru Gojo.

18:13.440 --> 18:18.370
Yet Takaba doesn't know anything
about his own technique.

18:26.790 --> 18:28.820
I don't get it! I don't get it!

18:28.820 --> 18:32.250
Ever since I became an adult,
I hardly understand anything!

18:37.920 --> 18:40.750
I've heard that all men are wolves,

18:40.750 --> 18:44.930
but it's always those wolves who take
care of the confusing stuff for me!

18:49.170 --> 18:51.810
If those wolves will handle everything,

18:51.810 --> 18:54.670
then I don't need to
think about anything!

18:54.670 --> 18:57.360
Because I'm so cute!

19:04.580 --> 19:07.650
Those wolves always... always...

19:16.290 --> 19:18.730
Don't, Megumi.

19:25.960 --> 19:27.150
You'll spare me?

19:35.520 --> 19:37.140
Shut up.

19:40.460 --> 19:42.450
Damn sister.

20:01.990 --> 20:05.070
Events progressed quickly
in the Sendai Colony,

20:02.220 --> 20:06.930
Sendai City, Miyagi Prefecture, November 12th, 11:28

20:05.070 --> 20:08.710
far outstripping those
of the Tokyo Colony

20:08.710 --> 20:10.420
and becoming especially fierce.

20:12.660 --> 20:17.270
Dhruv Lakdawalla. Current points: 91.

20:17.270 --> 20:19.070
This is his second incarnation.

20:19.800 --> 20:22.510
He's an old man who
single-handedly conquered

20:22.510 --> 20:25.270
this archipelago during
the Civil War of Wa.

20:25.870 --> 20:28.340
He possesses two autonomous shikigami,

20:28.340 --> 20:32.570
and the orbit of those shikigami
determines his domain.

20:35.510 --> 20:40.030
Ryu Ishigori. Current points: 77.

20:40.710 --> 20:45.130
He's the cannon with the greatest
cursed energy output among the Players.

20:46.760 --> 20:50.430
Takako Uro. Current points: 70.

20:51.130 --> 20:54.120
She was originally the captain of
the Sun, Moon, and Stars Squad,

20:54.120 --> 20:56.730
a squad of assassins serving
directly under the Fujiwara Clan.

20:57.260 --> 21:00.520
She possesses a technique that
allows her to manipulate "the sky."

21:01.740 --> 21:06.020
Kurourushi. Current points: 54.

21:06.020 --> 21:08.860
It's a cockroach cursed
spirit that Kenjaku freed

21:08.860 --> 21:12.020
from the control of cursed
spirit manipulation.

21:12.020 --> 21:15.880
It ranks as a special-grade
(already registered).

21:17.000 --> 21:20.840
It's currently lying dormant until
certain conditions are met.

21:22.160 --> 21:23.790
There was no alliance between them,

21:23.790 --> 21:27.590
but their complex compatibility
and opposing strength

21:27.590 --> 21:30.050
led them into a three—no,
a four-way stalemate.

21:30.580 --> 21:33.340
But one of those pillars

21:34.790 --> 21:36.160
has fallen.

21:37.600 --> 21:42.390
Yuta Okkotsu. Current points: 35.

21:43.040 --> 21:45.480
Three months after the
Night Parade of a Hundred Demons,

21:45.480 --> 21:47.980
he had blossomed as a
special-grade sorcerer.

21:47.980 --> 21:51.530
He was a modern sorcerer
rivaling Satoru Gojo

21:51.530 --> 21:53.070
in unusual abilities.

23:26.550 --> 23:28.400
I'll obtain 400 points on my own.

23:28.400 --> 23:31.080
Yuta, which would you like?

23:31.080 --> 23:32.310
It's called Kurourushi!

23:32.310 --> 23:32.810
Give me everything.

23:32.810 --> 23:35.340
Give me back Yuta!

23:35.340 --> 23:38.430
Sensei, I won't let you kill
your best friend twice.

23:36.970 --> 23:39.980
Next Episode
Sendai Colony
